WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,050
Handsome guy, do you have any bread or instant noodles?

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:08,050
I bought these brand-name bags for tens of thousands, can I exchange them for some food?

3
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:12,050
This woman's voice is clear and melodious, with a hint of a dancing girl, which is very nice.

4
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:15,050
These things are of no use to you, can you do something practical?

5
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:19,050
In fact, I also know that at this time, brand-name bags and other things are just clouds.

6
00:00:19,050 --> 00:00:21,050
Who else has the thought to dress up with a bag?

7
00:00:21,050 --> 00:00:24,050
I live alone and have no man to rely on.

8
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:26,210
But I don’t want to hand myself over just yet.

9
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:29,210
Although he calls me a handsome guy, he actually treats me as a loser.

10
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:32,210
Handsome guy, I have worn these before washing them.

11
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,210
Go aside.

12
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:37,660
I live in Wudong 301. If you want something to eat, just come to me with valuable items.

13
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:41,660
If it were money, I wouldn't even look at such a poor boy.

14
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:44,780
But what can we do now? People have food.
